<title>INDIA: BADMINTON-INDIAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-INDIAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the Indian</p>
<p>Open Grand Prix series badminton championship on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>3/4-Heryanto Arbi (Indonesia) beat 1-Poul Erik Hoyer-Larsen</p>
<p>(Denmark) 15-4 12-15 15-2</p>
<p>P.Gopichand (India) beat Kim Hyung-joon (South Korea) 15-8 15-9</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Lee Soon-deuk (South Korea) beat 2-Joanne Muggeridge (England)</p>
<p>11-3 11-8</p>
<p>1-Cindana Hartono (Indonesia) beat Choi Ma-ree (South Korea)</p>
<p>11-6 11-4</p>
</text>
